2026-03-28 23:05:11 - DEBUG - text=Butterflies also serve as a food source for birds, reptiles, and other insects, contributing to the overall biodiversity of their ecosystem., After a few days or weeks, the egg hatches, and a tiny larva, known as a caterpillar, emerges., From egg to larva to pupa to adult butterfly, each phase plays a vital role in the survival and reproduction of these beautiful insects., Once its wings are fully developed, the butterfly is ready to take flight for the first time., The first stage of a butterfly's life cycle is the egg stage., The third stage of the butterfly's life cycle is the pupa stage., target_entity=Biodiversity, related_kg=none, result=content='{\n  "central_entity": {\n    "name": "Biodiversity",\n    "type": "Ecological Concept",\n    "description": "Biodiversity refers to the variety and variability of life forms within a given species, ecosystem, or planet. It plays a crucial role in maintaining the balance and health of ecosystems.",\n    "attributes": [\n      {\n        "key": "Importance",\n        "value": "Maintains the balance and health of ecosystems"\n      },\n      {\n        "key": "Contribution",\n        "value": "Butterflies contribute to biodiversity through their role in the food chain and life cycle"\n      }\n    ],\n    "relationships": [\n      {\n        "relation": "Contributed By",\n        "target_name": "Butterflies",\n        "target_type": "Species",\n        "target_description": "Butterflies are a group of insects known for their colorful wings and important ecological roles.",\n        "relation_description": "Butterflies contribute to biodiversity by serving as a food source and playing a role in their ecosystem."\n      },\n      {\n        "relation": "Supported By",\n        "target_name": "Butterfly Life Cycle",\n        "target_type": "Biological Process",\n        "target_description": "The life cycle of a butterfly includes the stages of egg, larva (caterpillar), pupa, and adult butterfly.",\n        "relation_description": "The life cycle of butterflies supports biodiversity by ensuring the survival and reproduction of the species."\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}' additional_kwargs={'parsed': None, 'refusal': None} response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 313, 'prompt_tokens': 915, 'total_tokens': 1228, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': None, 'audio_tokens': None, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': None}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 32}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 32, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 883}, 'model_name': 'Qwen/Qwen3-32B', 'system_fingerprint': '', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None} id='run-ed53668d-0916-4a3f-8252-d1e9a941a7ff-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 915, 'output_tokens': 313, 'total_tokens': 1228, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 32}, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 0}}
