iving organisms that use flowers to attract pollinators and reproduce.",\n        "relation_description": "Flowers enable pollination for plants, which is essential for their reproduction and genetic diversity."\n      },\n      {\n        "relation": "Support",\n        "target_name": "agriculture",\n        "target_type": "Human Activity",\n        "target_description": "Agriculture is the practice of cultivating plants and raising animals for food, fiber, and other products.",\n        "relation_description": "Flowers support agriculture by enabling the pollination of many crops, which is vital for successful crop production."\n      },\n      {\n        "relation": "Impact",\n        "target_name": "bee population decline",\n        "target_type": "Environmental Issue",\n        "target_description": "Bee population decline refers to the reduction in the number of bees due to various environmental and human factors.",\n        "relation_description": "The decline of bee populations affects the pollination of flowers, which in turn threatens plant reproduction and agricultural sustainability."\n      },\n      {\n        "relation": "Influence",\n        "target_name": "ecosystem health",\n        "target_type": "Environmental Concept",\n        "target_description": "Ecosystem health refers to the condition of an ecosystem in terms of its ability to maintain its structure, function, and productivity.",\n        "relation_description": "Flowers influence ecosystem health by supporting pollinators and maintaining plant diversity."\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}' additional_kwargs={'parsed': None, 'refusal': None} response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 543, 'prompt_tokens': 912, 'total_tokens': 1455, 'completion_tokens_details': {'accepted_prediction_tokens': None, 'audio_tokens': None, 'reasoning_tokens': 0, 'rejected_prediction_tokens': None}, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 64}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 64, 'prompt_ca